    <section class="d-none card"><div class="card-body">
The results of the All American Jack&Jill prelim during Monterey Swinfest  2026 in  United States of America at 01/15/2026.<br />
<br />
Judges in this round were Estelle Bonnaire, Jessica Cox, Mackenzie Keister, Yenni Setiawan, Tony Schubert and Laurie Schwimmer.    </div></section>

